    <!--
        "Enjoying OSHI?" pre-ask (EnjoyingOshiSheet.kt).

        Shown once the user has sent a few messages, in front of Google Play's
        in-app review flow, which has a finite per-user quota. Keep the tone
        light and the two answers unmistakably opposite: only the positive one
        opens the store review, the negative one opens the help page.

        "OSHI" is the brand name and stays untranslated inside the title.
    -->
    <string name="review_preask_title">Enjoying OSHI?</string>
    <string name="review_preask_message">You\'ve been chatting for a while now. How is it going so far?</string>
